Leetcode - 105

Logic :
find the root node in inorder with the preorder[start]
keep that root node index "i" (inorder array)
create root node for that
pass the recursive call for left and right
for left call , pass the parameter , for inorder -> s till i-1 . for preorder -> sp+1 till sp+(i-si) size of left array of root node in inorder array
for right call, for inorder -> i+1 till e . for preorder -> sp+(i-si)+1 (rootnode +size of left array+1) till ep (end of array)

for inorder pointer , if s greater than e pointer
return null

In the end return the root

Code:

TreeNode build(int[] preorder,int[] inorder,int sp,int ep,int is,int ie,HashMap<Integer,Integer> map){
        if(is>ie){
            return null;
        }
        int i=map.get(preorder[sp]);
        TreeNode node=new TreeNode(preorder[sp]);
        node.left=build(preorder,inorder,sp+1,sp-is+i,is,i-1,map);
        node.right=build(preorder,inorder,sp-is+i+1,ep,i+1,ie,map);
        return node;
  }
